{"version":1,"content":"<p>嵯峨野觀光鐵道公司周五（23日）介紹運行於京都市嵐山至名勝風景區保津峽之間的「嵯峨野遊覽小火車」新列車，車身側面至頂部均採用大面積玻璃設計，相比現有車輛提升了觀景體驗。</p><p>新列車預計2027年3月1日起運行。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:02:01.784265+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:22:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T08:58:19.999710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:58:11.761541+00:00","content_hash":"2940d7217b4c05fbb94a6f1fbbb9e750540e0843ffce1d5f0236ca5b3e99b507","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}